3d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 3959, \"chunk_count\": 3, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:50:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:11:18\", \"token_count\": 1379, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-07]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-11-26\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3581463689  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-11-26T14:02:28Z · **Updated**: 2025-11-26T16:36:01Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-11-20  \\n\\n## Attendees\\n\\n- Tyler Yahn  \\n\\n- Owen Williams  \\n\\n- Sam Xie\\n\\n- Alex Boten  \\n\\n- David Ashpole  \\n\\n- Bryan Boreham  \\n\\n- (Mentioned: Robert Pająk)\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-07]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2025-11-26\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3581463689  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2025-11-26T14:02:28Z · **Updated**: 2025-11-26T16:36:01Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\\n---\\n\\n**Date:** 2025-11-20  \\n\\n## Discussions\\n\\n### 1. Next Go release & OTelConf RC support\\n\\n- Release blocked on RC support module; PR needs reviews.\\n\\n- Requested changes from Alex do not need to be in the current PR.\\n\\n- Module is `0.x`; breaking changes acceptable later.\\n\\n- Avoid exposing public API known to be removed immediately.\\n\\n- Discussed handling experimental features:\\n\\n  - `WithExperimentalFeatures`-style flag likely unhelpful.\\n\\n  - Possible `x` submodule to clearly isolate experimental APIs.\\n\\n  - Aligns with OTel-wide push for opt-in experimental features.\\n\\n### 2. HTTP default client deprecation (OTel HTTP)\\n\\n- Work deprecating default HTTP client usage is in progress.\\n\\n- `POST`/`GET` helpers rely on `http.DefaultClient` and limit configurability.\\n\\n- Follow-up PRs exist; need review for inclusion in upcoming release.\\n\\n### 3. Observability work & non-blocking PRs\\n\\n- Several observability PRs (e.g., self-observability for OTel gRPC) are ongoing, not release-blocking.\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"sourc id src note 07 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2025 11 26 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3581463689 author pellar creat 2025 11 26t14 02 28z updat 2025 11 26t16 36 01z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 11 20 attende tyler yahn owen william sam xie alex boten david ashpol bryan boreham mention robert paj ą k sourc id src note 07 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2025 11 26 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3581463689 author pellar creat 2025 11 26t14 02 28z updat 2025 11 26t16 36 01z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z date 2025 11 20 discuss 1 next go releas otelconf rc support releas block on rc support modul pr need review request chang from alex do not need to be in the current pr modul is 0 x break chang accept later avoid expos public api known to be remov immedi discuss handl experiment featur withexperimentalfeatur style flag like unhelp possibl x submodul to clear isol experiment api align with otel wide push for opt in experiment featur 2 http default client deprec otel http work deprec default http client usag is in progress post get helper reli on http defaultcli and limit configur follow up pr exist need review for inclus in upcom releas 3 observ work non block pr sever observ pr e g self observ for otel grpc are ongo not releas block\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"0740d1ea8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md\", \"id\": \"c5a65f87687b3520\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3411551567660872, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.17307692395155322, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7333377, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"0740d1ea8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3581463689.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 3959, \"chunk_count\": 3, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:50:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:11:18\", \"token_count\": 1379, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"    - Problem statement\\n\\n    - Alternatives\\n\\n    - Pros/cons\\n\\n    - Links to Go runtime and `pprof` semantics\\n\\n  - Keep current large PR as draft / proof of concept.\\n\\n### 2. Reviews & Contributor Support\\n\\n- Maintainers emphasized the need for **more PR reviews** (reviews from non-approvers are valuable).\\n\\n- Nico asked for smaller starter tasks.\\n\\n  - Suggested areas:\\n\\n    - Flaky tests in `opentelemetry-go-contrib`\\n\\n    - Open issues in core and contrib repositories\\n\\n- Meeting notes and active PR references are pinned in the repository for visibility.\\n\\n- Guidance:\\n\\n  - Prefer **atomic PRs** (one change per PR).\\n\\n  - If a PR contains “and”, it likely should be split.\\n\\n  - Assigned issues may be stale — double-check activity before skipping.\\n\\n### 3. New Contributor Introduction\\n\\n- Michal introduced himself and offered help.\\n\\n- Requested onboarding guidance / buddy support.\\n\\n- Recommendations:\\n\\n  - Review `CONTRIBUTING.md`\\n\\n  - Browse open issues and PRs\\n\\n  - Ask on Slack for direction or clarification\\n\\n### 4. Kafka & Auto-Instrumentation Placement\\n\\n- Question: Why some auto-instrumentations (e.g., Kafka) live in `opentelemetry-go` instead of `contrib`?\\n\\n- Context:\\n\\n  - Some instrumentations were historical donations.\\n\\n  - Sarama instrumentation was deprecated and moved under Shopify due to lack of maintainers.\\n\\n  - Auto-instrumentation landscape in Go is fragmented:\\n\\n    - eBPF-based approaches\\n\\n    - Compile-time instrumentation\\n\\n    - Separate Auto-Instrumentation SIG\\n\\n- Recommendation:\\n\\n  - Join the Go Auto-Instrumentation SIG meeting.\\n\\n  - Use the dedicated Slack channel for deeper discussion.\\n\\n### 5. Community Announcements\\n\\n- Reminder: OpenTelemetry event (unconference style) in Brussels, Monday after FOSDEM (early February).\\n\\n**Source ID**: [SRC-NOTE-08]\\n\\n# Meeting Note: OpenTelemetry Go SIG — 2026-02-27\\n\\n**Canonical URL**: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/issues/6648#issuecomment-3974113940  \\n\\n**Author**: pellared  \\n\\n**Created**: 2026-02-27T17:20:46Z · **Updated**: 2026-02-27T17:21:05Z  \\n\\n**Collected**: 2026-07-14T14:35:41Z\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"problem statement altern pro con link to go runtim and pprof semant keep current larg pr a draft proof of concept 2 review contributor support maintain emphas the need for more pr review review from non approv are valuabl nico ask for smaller starter task suggest area flaki test in opentelemetri go contrib open issu in core and contrib repositori meet note and activ pr refer are pin in the repositori for visibl guidanc prefer atom pr one chang per pr if a pr contain and it like should be split assign issu may be stale doubl check activ befor skip 3 new contributor introduct michal introduc himself and offer help request onboard guidanc buddi support recommend review contribut md brows open issu and pr ask on slack for direct or clarif 4 kafka auto instrument placement question whi some auto instrument e g kafka live in opentelemetri go instead of contrib context some instrument were histor donat sarama instrument wa deprec and move under shopifi due to lack of maintain auto instrument landscap in go is fragment ebpf base approach compil time instrument separ auto instrument sig recommend join the go auto instrument sig meet use the dedic slack channel for deeper discuss 5 communiti announc remind opentelemetri event unconfer style in brussel monday after fosdem earli februari sourc id src note 08 meet note opentelemetri go sig 2026 02 27 canon url http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go issu 6648 issuecom 3974113940 author pellar creat 2026 02 27t17 20 46z updat 2026 02 27t17 21 05z collect 2026 07 14t14 35 41z\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"0737354a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3974113940.md\", \"id\": \"82340480ff68c117\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.33794253631878696, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.15384615474112423, \"vector_similarity\": 0.76750076, \"dataset_name\": \"С2WR-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3974113940.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"0737354a8a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3974113940.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/meeting-notes/entry-3974113940.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 3929, \"chunk_count\": 3, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:50:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:11:24\", \"token_count\": 1330, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"b5f5be0e8a9b11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# Work State Index\\n\\n**Source cutoff**: 2026-02-27T17:20:46Z\\n\\n**Final Work State through**: 2026-03-11\\n\\n**Source link scheme:** paths are relative to the final handoff location\\n\\n`work-registry/work-states/